### Devfy API Quality Assurance Test Suite
### Jalankan menggunakan ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code atau Cursor

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@testEmail = qa_tester@devfy.local
@testUsername = qatester
@testPassword = Password123!

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Registrasi Akun Baru
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "QA Specialist",
  "username": "{{testUsername}}",
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### 3. Login Akun (Menghasilkan Bearer Token)
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Ambil token dari respons login di atas
@authToken = {{loginUser.response.body.token}}

### 4. Mengambil Profil Pengguna Saat Ini
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Memperbarui Data Profil dan Keahlian
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "QA Automation Engineer",
  "bio": "Menguji keandalan sistem, arsitektur REST API, dan pengalaman pengguna end to end.",
  "location": "Jakarta, Indonesia",
  "skills": ["Vitest", "Playwright", "Postman", "TypeScript", "Docker"],
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/qatester",
  "portfolioPublished": true
}

### 6. Menambahkan Proyek Portofolio Baru
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API Automated Testing Framework",
  "slug": "api-testing-framework",
  "description": "Framework otomatisasi pengujian endpoint terdistribusi dengan pelaporan metrik performa real time.",
  "techStack": ["TypeScript", "Vitest", "Docker", "Node.js"],
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/qatester/api-testing-framework",
  "demoUrl": "https://demo.devfy.local",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### Simpan project ID yang baru dibuat
@projectId = {{createProject.response.body.project.id}}

### 7. Mengambil Daftar Seluruh Proyek Pengguna
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Memperbarui Status Proyek
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API Automated Testing Framework v2",
  "status": "PUBLISHED"
}

### 9. Mengakses Portofolio Publik (Tanpa Autentikasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/{{testUsername}}

### 10. Mengakses Detail Proyek Publik
GET {{baseUrl}}/public/{{testUsername}}/projects/api-testing-framework

### 11. Permintaan Pemulihan Kata Sandi (Forgot Password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}"
}

### 12. Menghapus Proyek
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
